APPLYING LIBRARY INTELLECTUAL FREEDOM PRINCIPLES TO PUBLIC AND
ACADEMIC COMPUTERS
                                       
   by Carl M. Kadie (kadie@eff.org)
   
   For Computers, Freedom, and Privacy '94 on March 26, 1994
   
   Version 3 (corrections requested)
   
   (Also available: the rough draft, the first final draft, and other
   conference items.)
   
